<title>USA: Osmonics agrees to buy  AquaMatic.</title>
<headline>Osmonics agrees to buy  AquaMatic.</headline>
<dateline>MINNETONKA, Minn. 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Osmonics Inc said Tuesday it agreed in principle to acquire  AquaMatic Inc for cash. Terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>AquaMatic provides supplies for the water purification industry. It is expected to post 1996 sales of more than $12 million.</p>
<p>Osmonics said it expects to complete the acquisition in January, 1997.</p>
<p>Osmonics manufactures and markets water purification and fluid filtration products.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
